<<~ ahu slot=`#/purpose`>>

`outcome.ts` tells an outcome: the call's change report, the receipt and cancel queries, a visit's withheld body, the vessel's own wait ending, the input digest a re-ask must match, the held ask. Pure helpers: no store, no socket, no clock. The DAM checklist (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/uds-channel-dam`>>) carries its observations.

